{
  "segments": [
    {
      "text": "Slingshot 的起点是 n×J 的归一化表达矩阵，因此 normalized_expression=present 满足其基本输入条件。",
      "basis": "KG_GROUNDED",
      "citations": [
        {
          "index": 1,
          "quote": "We start from an n×J matrix of normalized expression measures (e.g., read counts) for n single cells and J genes or features."
        }
      ],
      "context_fact_ids": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Slingshot 假设细胞已被划分为 K 个簇，cluster_labels=present 满足这一算法假设。",
      "basis": "KG_GROUNDED",
      "citations": [
        {
          "index": 1,
          "quote": "Slingshot assumes that the n cells have been partitioned into K clusters, potentially corresponding to distinct cellular states."
        }
      ],
      "context_fact_ids": []
    },
    {
      "text": "降维是强烈推荐而非必需，reduced_dimensions=present 满足推荐条件，但即使缺失也可直接使用归一化表达。",
      "basis": "KG_GROUNDED",
      "citations": [
        {
          "index": 1,
          "quote": "Although Slingshot can in principle be applied directly to the normalized expression measures, we strongly recommend a dimensionality reduction step before pseudotemporal reconstruction"
        }
      ],
      "context_fact_ids": []
    },
    {
      "text": "已知末端簇是可选的局部监督，不限制全局谱系数量；cluster_labels 存在并不自动提供末端状态信息。",
      "basis": "KG_GROUNDED",
      "citations": [
        {
          "index": 3,
          "quote": "Slingshot optionally allows the user to provide further supervision in the inference of the lineages by selecting clusters known to represent terminal cell states, imposing a local constraint on the MST algorithm."
        }
      ],
      "context_fact_ids": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Slingshot 会为每个谱系推断 pseudotime，因此该任务在方法能力范围内。",
      "basis": "KG_GROUNDED",
      "citations": [
        {
          "index": 5,
          "quote": "For each lineage, identification of pseudotimes, i.e., a one-dimensional variable representing each cell’s transcriptional progression toward the terminal state."
        }
      ],
      "context_fact_ids": []
    },
    {
      "text": "提醒：论文版本要求用户指定初始簇或根节点，这属于版本特定的输入说明，不代表所有软件版本都必须显式传入 root 参数。",
      "basis": "CAUTION_CONTEXT",
      "citations": [
        {
          "index": 7,
          "quote": "Slingshot requires the user to identify the initial cluster or root node."
        }
      ],
      "context_fact_ids": []
    }
  ],
  "clarification": null
}
